+# Third-party 3D assets — IRON-FRONT 0.12
+
+## 3DAssets.dev — Tanks, Military Vehicles and Field Camp
+- Pack: https://3dassets.dev/packs/armoured-column-and-field-camp
+- Licence: CC0 1.0 Universal (commercial use and modification permitted; attribution not required).
+- Pack declaration: 74 GLB models, 74,216 triangles, approximately 3.5 MB total; metres, +Y up.
+- Selected models are downloaded during the build by `tools/fetch-3dassets-pack.sh` from the publisher CDN.
+
+| In-game role | Model | Publisher asset ID | CDN URL |
+|---|---|---:|---|
+| Main battle tank / heavy tank | Main Battle Tank | 23667 | https://cdn.3dassets.dev/assets/23667/v1/model.glb |
+| APC | Tracked APC | 23668 | https://cdn.3dassets.dev/assets/23668/v1/model.glb |
+| Self-propelled artillery | Self-Propelled Gun | 23670 | https://cdn.3dassets.dev/assets/23670/v1/model.glb |
+| Recon vehicle | Armoured Car | 23669 | https://cdn.3dassets.dev/assets/23669/v1/model.glb |
+| Supply / haul truck | Supply Truck | 23674 | https://cdn.3dassets.dev/assets/23674/v1/model.glb |
+
+The publisher describes these models as static geometry without rigs or animation. Vehicle movement remains controlled by the existing game simulation. The current in-game faction tint is applied as a subtle material tint to cloned model materials.
